From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:18:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Added: Notify when background sessions exit or ring the bell

While the activity is not visible, post a notification when a session
exits or rings the bell, titled like its tab. Tapping it opens the
activity on that session. A session has at most one notification, a bell
is notified once until the session is displayed again, and the
notification is removed when the session is displayed. Sessions killed
by exiting from the service notification and plugin command sessions
that return their result are not notified.

The new terminal-session-notifications = all | exit | bell | off
property selects what is notified, all by default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GLNsTPnn2xKUQ4uFcevT6G
